    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\n'mini.nvim' itself does not yet use `>lang` notation in help files since it currently supports Neovim>=0.7.0 and this notation became non-breaking in 0.8.2 (and actually useful in 0.9.0).\r\n\r\nI plan to give 'mini.doc' an update resolving some other issues (#666, #668) and will see if adding this change will be worth it at that point.",
